@startuml
' OWNER-MVP-2026-11-04 review: MVP core / cross-cutting. Core presentation/application/files or shared authority/recovery invariant remains applicable.
skinparam backgroundColor #0D1525
skinparam defaultFontColor #EDF4FF
skinparam defaultFontName Segoe UI
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #91AED1
skinparam activityBackgroundColor #1A2940
skinparam activityBorderColor #91AED1
skinparam activityDiamondBackgroundColor #4A302B
skinparam activityDiamondBorderColor #F1AD8A
skinparam activityStartColor #60C7E5
skinparam activityEndColor #60C7E5
skinparam wrapWidth 190
skinparam maxMessageSize 180

title CF-M01 — Selected resume update and separate publication
start
:CF-M01-S01\nInitiating actor\nOwner has changed shared\ninformation and chooses whether to\npreview/apply it for one resume.;
if (CF-M01-S02\nCurrent source/resume authority\nand intended context valid?) then (yes)
:CF-M01-S03\nOwner / System\nIdentify source differences and\nintended independent resume;
if (CF-M01-S04\nOwner chooses to preview and apply\nselected changes?) then (yes)
:CF-M01-S05\nOwner\nReview selection and preserve\nindependent overrides;
:CF-M01-S06\nSystem\nRecheck selected context; attempt\nonly permitted selected draft save;
if (CF-M01-S07\nSelected context still valid and\nsave confirmed?) then (yes)
:CF-M01-S08\nSystem\nRetain selected draft only;\npreserve other resumes and actual\nsent material;
if (CF-M01-S09\nOwner separately confirms\npublication?) then (yes)
:CF-M01-S10\nSystem\nRecheck intended\ncontent/authority; attempt only\nseparately confirmed eligible\npublication;
if (CF-M01-S11\nPublication actually confirmed?) then (yes)
:CF-M01-S12\nSystem\nIntended live presentation\nupdated; actual submitted content\npreserved;
stop
else (no)
:CF-M01-S13\nSystem\nPublication unconfirmed or failed;\nreconcile actual presentation;
stop
endif
else (no)
:CF-M01-S14\nSystem\nDraft saved; live presentation\nunchanged by this save;
stop
endif
else (no)
:CF-M01-S15\nSystem\nNo successful apply claimed; show\nconflict/failure/uncertainty and\nreconcile;
stop
endif
else (no)
:CF-M01-S16\nSystem\nSource edit alone changes no\nexisting resume draft or\npublication;
stop
endif
else (no)
:CF-M01-S17\nSystem\nDeny before prohibited effect or\nprotected disclosure; report unmet\ngate;
stop
endif
legend bottom
A: accepted profile core only. Other policy detail: P / proposed refinement.
Step IDs identify full descriptions in the activity view.
Logical ordering; no atomicity, runtime, timing or execution proof.
endlegend
@enduml
